<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450431" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 3— Equation in a table cell</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d677e7">
         <p>Consider a <codeph>&lt;table&gt;</codeph> where one of the <codeph>&lt;td&gt;</codeph> cells contains a <codeph>&lt;math&gt;</codeph> element — for example, a reference table listing formulas alongside their descriptions.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Equation in a table cell</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_pby_vfn_lkc">
&lt;table>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;th>Formula&lt;/th>
    &lt;th>Description&lt;/th>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>
      &lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
        &lt;mrow>
          &lt;mi>R&lt;/mi>
          &lt;mo>=&lt;/mo>
          &lt;mfrac>
            &lt;mi>B&lt;/mi>
            &lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>
          &lt;/mfrac>
        &lt;/mrow>
      &lt;/math>
    &lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Transfer rate&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_jh2_wfn_lkc">
&lt;simpletable>
  &lt;sthead>
    &lt;stentry>Formula&lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>Description&lt;/stentry>
  &lt;/sthead>
  &lt;strow>
    &lt;stentry>
      &lt;equation-inline>
        &lt;mathml>
          &lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            &lt;mrow>
              &lt;mi>R&lt;/mi>
              &lt;mo>=&lt;/mo>
              &lt;mfrac>
                &lt;mi>B&lt;/mi>
                &lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>
              &lt;/mfrac>
            &lt;/mrow>
          &lt;/math>
        &lt;/mathml>
      &lt;/equation-inline>
    &lt;/stentry>
    &lt;stentry>Transfer rate&lt;/stentry>
  &lt;/strow>
&lt;/simpletable></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p><b>Result:</b> The converter processes the <codeph>&lt;math&gt;</codeph> element within the <codeph>&lt;td&gt;</codeph> cell and converts it to an <codeph>&lt;equation-inline&gt;</codeph> element containing the MathML content, placed inside the corresponding DITA <codeph>&lt;stentry&gt;</codeph>. The equation is treated as inline content within the cell and does not break out of the table cell boundary.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
